  "text": "Kashmir Tours - India | Prestige Holidays 4U Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Home Domestic International Packages Customize Trip About Contact +91 63618 77187 Domestic Kashmir India Heaven on Earth with Dal Lake, houseboats, and snow-capped peaks Why Visit Kashmir? Kashmir, often called &#x27;Paradise on Earth,&#x27; captivates visitors with its stunning natural beauty. Float on the serene Dal Lake in traditional shikaras, stay in charming houseboats, and witness the majestic Himalayan peaks. Explore Mughal gardens, experience the thrill of skiing in Gulmarg, and savor authentic Kashmiri cuisine. The valley&#x27;s scenic beauty and warm hospitality create unforgettable memories. Best Time to Visit March to August (Summer), December to February (Winter Sports) Top Attractions Dal Lake Shikara Ride Gulmarg Gondola Previous slide Next slide Dal Lake Shikara Ride Gulmarg Gondola Mughal Gardens Pahalgam Valley Sonamarg Glacier Shankaracharya Temple Activities & Experiences Shikara Rides Skiing & Snowboarding Trekking Houseboat Stays Shopping for Handicrafts Photography Plan Your Trip Enquire Now WhatsApp Us Contact Information Phone +91 63618 77187 Email showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Your trusted partner for domestic and international travel experiences. Creating memorable journeys since years. Quick Links Home Domestic Tours International Tours Tour Packages About Us Contact Us Popular Destinations Goa Kerala Maldives Dubai Switzerland Thailand Contact Info No 638/G, HBR 1st Stage, 2nd Block, HBR Layout, Karnataka, Bengaluru – 560043 +91 63618 77187 showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com © 2026 Prestige Holidays 4U. All rights reserved. Chat with us on WhatsApp"
